                },
                "category": null,
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The living virus' last action was a successful injector Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The living virus injects the target with a degrading corruption, dealing @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage. The target must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:13] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and becomes clumsy 1 for 1 minute.</p>"
